  "description": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Brand:</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Encanto Scents is a premium fragrance brand proudly bottled in Australia using the finest imported materials. Known for creating captivating scents that evoke elegance and individuality, Encanto Scents offers a diverse collection crafted to inspire every personality and occasion.</span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Product Description:</span></strong><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Our product line includes an exquisite range of perfumes categorized into Amber, Timeless, Floral, Citrus, Fruity, and Woody scents. Encanto Scents embodies sophistication and uniqueness, making each bottle a luxurious experience for our customers.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Affordable Luxury: High-quality scents inspired by luxury perfumes at a fraction of the price</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Australian-Bottled Excellence: A local touch with global quality.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Crafted for Diversity: Scents tailored for every mood, personality, and occasion.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Ethically Packaged: Thoughtfully designed with sustainability in mind.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Payment Terms:</span></strong><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Affiliates earn a 10% commission on all sales referred via their unique link or coupon code.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Payments are made monthly, directly to the affiliate's preferred method, once a minimum threshold of $50 is reached.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">All commissions are calculated based on net sales (excluding taxes and returns).</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"></span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Other Information:</span></strong><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Tracking Period: Referrals are tracked with a 30-day cookie to ensure affiliates are credited for delayed purchases.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Marketing Assets: Affiliates gain access to free, high-quality marketing materials, including banners, social media templates, and product images.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Support: Dedicated support is available for affiliates to answer questions, provide insights, and offer promotional tips.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Program Flexibility: Affiliates can promote Encanto Scents through blogs, social media, email campaigns, and more.</span></p>",
